# Design Fidelity

## Source of truth

- Tokens: `docs/handoff/design_handoff_kindly/DESIGN_TOKENS.md`
- Screens: `docs/handoff/design_handoff_kindly/screens/*.png`
- Prototype: `docs/handoff/design_handoff_kindly/design/Kindly.dc.html`

## Colors

- Primary/brand: oxblood `#7F3523` only — no stray accent colors.
- Success: olive `#7C7838` only (toasts, checks).
- Clay `#9C5A44` for eyebrows; soft peach `#F1E3D6` for tinted surfaces.

## Typography

- DM Sans: all UI (400/500/600/700).
- DM Serif Display: **only** Sentient wordmark and Send-back reply preview.

## Components

- Buttons: pill shape, 0.12em tracking, min-height 48px.
- Cards: 12–22px radius, soft shadow, 1px low-contrast border.
- Pills: 11px labels; accent / success / neutral variants per tokens.

## Motion

- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. Entrance fade-rise 360ms; minimal animation otherwise.
